reporting: one chartered clause satisfies a multi-clause Decision. DO: per-clause charter edges, which needs a Decision to have addressable clauses. VERIFY: a Decision with one of two clauses chartered is reported. CARRIED because it is a schema question. WHEN EACH LANDS: the fix is ARMED against the broken predicate (D0253 - a control-defect fix never observed to change a verdict has not been shown to fix anything), and its control-defects.toml entry is removed in the SAME commit that resolves the Issue, never before."; }
