        action dcSharedParsedModel;
        verification dcSharedParsedModelDoD : Test { :>> id = "c50fa127-9b46-4e83-8d71-63ae02b48f95"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::test; :>> procedureText = "Resolves issue142. A cold burst of the eight endpoints the console requests takes 5.2s and the same burst warm takes 0.5s, so roughly nine tenths of a cold load is recomputation over an already-parsed corpus. DO: instrument FIRST - per-phase timing inside Model::build and a per-view parse counter, because three separate wall-clock inferences were wrong before instrumentation was tried - then share one parsed model per content fingerprint across the 74 Model::build call sites, and consider whether composite views (assured, coverage) should reuse their component views results rather than recomputing them. VERIFY with repeated samples on a WARMED binary, never a single post-build run: the cold burst should approach the warm burst, and every view must return byte-identical JSON before and after."; }
