        action dcObligationActionable;
        verification dcObligationActionableDoD : Test { :>> id = "8f36b0d4-71ca-4e29-95b8-04e7c218a6f3"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::demo; :>> procedureText = "Resolves issue141 and delivers srConsoleObligationActionable / UC-C7. DO: carry the viewpoint IDENTITY on every obligation class the surface reports; bind card clicks by that identity via one delegated handler rather than by DOM position; select the destination's SURFACE as well so the nav agrees with what is rendered; give only cards with a resolvable target the affordance; and serve any declared viewpoint's computed view generically so a card always lands on something real. VERIFY: the two act destinations that had no endpoint (authority-queue, sitting-coverage) return their computed views; an unbound command FAILS LOUD naming the CLI command rather than rendering blank; the positional binding is gone from the served console; the obligation counts are unchanged through the unified dispatch; and the human confirms a click lands where the work is."; }
